ed by <strong>reseru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/577834-moar-previews-humbly-requested?p=835700#post835700\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No, we had a list but I always seem to lose where I saved it. I think one of the cities talked about having slumbering monsters beneath it or something; another one had weird Disquiet effects maybe? It's been a couple years at this point</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/230252-what-do-you-want-to-see-in-the-firestorm-chronicles?p=293551#post293551\">A little over one, actually</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-24T05:06:24-08:00","id":836352,"title":"","content":"Coincidentally enough I was hoping you'd be the one to point us in the direction, because that's what happened the last time some asked what the <b>Promethean</b> settings were and I said I kinda knew but forgot <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-24T11:32:12-08:00","id":836552,"title":"","content":"Dates be damned, it was nigh on twenty years since the last preview. I remember having taken in Changeling: the Dreaming, and, having come out of my distraction, realizing that the upcoming Aeon preview should have rightfully been Promethean previews. I wrote an angry posting on the AOL WW forum, about how we were being led along. Yes, the newly minted &quot;old&quot; World of Darkness was a delight, and a new and bold vision for role-playing games, but what of the classic Chronicles of Darkness they'd skirted around for years? Why hadn't there been a Promethean reboot in the so-called world, which was just an epic re-imagining of the other CoD lines? So many people were made happy when Demons got their Judeo-Christian angelology, so why couldn't we have the mad scientist transhumanist rebi whose Phlogistonic Orgone batteries had been hinted at since early Werewolf? I later corrected myself when someone pointed out they were in Ars Magica, back in the Lion Rampant days, but my point stood. Anyway, I'd sure could go for another preview.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>LFP: Foreign Bodies (Deviant: the Renegades)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/969-verge","name":"Verge","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"378"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-24T13:38:44-08:00","id":836646,"title":"","content":"Just as a point of reference, know that there SHALL be <b>Promethean: the Created</b> Second Edition. I know. I've seen a couple versions of it. Yes, I was/ am/ shall ever be in the playtest group for the game. It's real, but I cannot say more about it until it drops or until Black Hat Matt says so... As ever, I urge patience. Sorry I cannot offer more.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>B.I.G. Bird spreads the word: Anybody with a heart votes love<br /> <a href=\"https://absintheandthorns.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://absintheandthorns.obsidianportal.com/</a></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/409-phaolan","name":"Phaolan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar409_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"478"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-29T07:06:43-07:00","id":855054,"title":"","content":"Soooo with Easter that just went flying past, we celebrated the resurection of a man who might or might not have been a Promethean... if only I had any sort of preview to help me say if Jesus was a Promethean or not like, I don't know, Innate Powers or Transmutations.<br /> <br /> Not asking for anything, just, you know, saying what's on my mind.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Glorious Useless-Post Prana<br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Cost: 2</span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">m; </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mins: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Linguistics 1, Essence 1 </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Type: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Simple</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Keywords: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mute</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Duration: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Instant</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Prerequisite Charms: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Ten-Characters Methodology</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2589-magnum-opus","name":"Magnum Opus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2589_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"821"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-29T11:43:16-07:00","id":855151,"title":"","content":"I mean, it's all there. The Alchemy, the drive to change, the slow accumulation of Disquiet. I mean, an Azoth 1 Promethean can stay in an area for about six months now without triggering a Wasteland which is what allows for end-stage Disquiet. And that Jesus fellow did move around a lot. Disquiet mitigation techniques, maybe? And isn't death a necessary part of the New Dawn if the Promethean hasn't died already? Resurrection via Azoth flare, anyone? And the things that happened during the crucifixion, like the dead walking, and darkness in the sky, etc. sure sound like a Firestorm to me.<br /> <br /> It's impossible to tell without knowing about Bestowments or Transmutations. Oh well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127694-arcanist-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><b>My Homebrew Hub</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist","name":"Arcanist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-31T07:01:20-07:00","id":856446,"title":"","content":"I'll try and do a preview this weekend. No, for serious. I'm finally done redlining <b>Changeling 20th</b>, so I can breathe a little. I need to do some writing today (some <b>Promethean</b>-related, as a matter of fact), but then I'll see what I can do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-31T07:55:19-07:00","id":856474,"title":"","content":"YAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAY!<br /> <br /> We need more Promethean in our lives. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-31T08:01:34-07:00","id":856478,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=